{
  "_readme": "Client-side indicative estimator. Range = starting price × product of group multipliers × (1 + extras%), rounded to round_to. Multipliers express scope/complexity only — never who the customer is. Estimates are NOT payable; final quote only after reviewing the requirement. Internal hourly-floor checks live in scripts/price_floor_check.py (private data, not in this repo).",
  "_todo_rules": "OWNER: review these multipliers (drafted 2026-09-14). They change the ranges visitors see.",
